msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "補足:"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:45
msgid "Center retuning widens the stored radius by the induced center displacement so the enclosure never shrinks."
msgstr "中心値の再量子化で生じる変位は半径へ加えられ、包絡が縮まないようにします。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:46
msgid "Radius quantization always rounds outward."
msgstr "半径の量子化は常に外向きに丸められます。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:48
msgid "Accessors and Interval Shape"
msgstr "アクセサと区間形状"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:65
msgid "`center()` and `radius()` abort on unbounded intervals."
msgstr "`center()` と `radius()` は非有界区間では abort します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:66
msgid "If the enclosure spans both negative and positive values, `sign()` returns `Sign::Zero`."
msgstr "包絡が負値と正値の両方をまたぐと `sign()` は `Sign::Zero` を返します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:67
msgid "`classify()` reports `Infinity` for unbounded intervals."
msgstr "`classify()` は非有界区間に対して `Infinity` を返します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:69
msgid "Relations and Comparison"
msgstr "関係と比較"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:81
msgid "Relations are enclosure-oriented and intentionally do not pretend to be a scalar total order."
msgstr "これらは enclosure relation であり、scalar の全順序を装いません。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:83
msgid "Arithmetic and Checked Capability Behavior"
msgstr "算術と checked capability の挙動"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:85
msgid "Context And Status"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:87
msgid "`BallContext` applies directed endpoint rounding and `BallFlags` reports inexact, overflow, and underflow without changing set semantics."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:100
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:126
#: manual/api/decimal.md:222
msgid "Supported operators:"
msgstr "対応演算子:"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:106
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:132
#: manual/api/decimal.md:228
msgid "unary `-`"
msgstr "単項 `-`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:108
#: manual/api/bin_float.md:153
msgid "Checked-behavior notes:"
msgstr "checked 挙動メモ:"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:110
#, fuzzy
msgid "Checked division may widen to the whole-real enclosure when the divisor contains zero."
msgstr "checked division は分母包絡が `0` を含むと whole-real enclosure へ広がることがあります。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:111
msgid "Checked integer power preserves enclosure correctness and uses the same whole-real fallback for zero-containing inverse cases."
msgstr "checked integer power は enclosure の正しさを保ち、零交差を含む逆冪でも同じ whole-real fallback を使います。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:112
msgid "`BallFloat` does not implement scalar `CompareChecked`."
msgstr "`BallFloat` は scalar `CompareChecked` を実装しません。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:113
msgid "General power uses the IEEE 1788 nonnegative-base domain; negative-base integer powers remain the responsibility of `pown`."
msgstr "一般の冪は IEEE 1788 の非負底定義域に従い、負底の整数冪は引き続き `pown` が担います。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:114
msgid "The package does not yet expose hyperbolic or inverse trigonometric functions, calculus, matrices, complex balls, or special functions."
msgstr "このパッケージは双曲・逆三角関数、微積分、行列、複素 ball、特殊関数をまだ公開しません。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:116
msgid "`BallContext::new` is a convenience constructor with positive-precision and ordered-exponent preconditions. Use `BallContext::try_new` for external parameters. `BallFlags` exposes `inexact`, `overflow`, `underflow`, and `combine` accessors; callers should use these methods instead of depending on field layout."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:122
msgid "Decorated Intervals"
msgstr "Decorated interval"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:124
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated` intentionally lives in the same `ball_float` package as `BallFloat`. Consumers import only `Luna-Flow/floating/ball_float`; there is no separate `Luna-Flow/floating/decorated_ball_float` package. Bare intervals, decorated intervals, contexts, and IEEE 1788 set semantics therefore share one package boundary."
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated` は `BallFloat` と同じ `ball_float` パッケージに属します。利用側が import するのは `Luna-Flow/floating/ball_float` だけであり、独立した `Luna-Flow/floating/decorated_ball_float` パッケージはありません。bare interval、decorated interval、context、IEEE 1788 の集合意味論は一つのパッケージ境界を共有します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:130
msgid "`Decoration` is ordered from weakest to strongest as `Ill`, `Trv`, `Def`, `Dac`, and `Com`. `BallFloatDecorated` stores an underlying `BallFloat`, a decoration, and an independent NaI state:"
msgstr "`Decoration` は弱い順に `Ill`、`Trv`、`Def`、`Dac`、`Com` です。 `BallFloatDecorated` は underlying `BallFloat`、decoration、独立した NaI 状態を保持します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:134
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::new` wraps a bare interval."
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::new` は bare interval を包みます。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:135
msgid "`BallFloatDecorated::nai` constructs NaI; NaI uses `Ill` but is not Empty."
msgstr "`BallFloatDecorated::nai` は NaI を構築します。NaI は `Ill` ですが Empty ではありません。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:136
msgid "`interval`, `decoration`, and `is_nai` expose the three observations."
msgstr "`interval`、`decoration`、`is_nai` で三つの状態を観測できます。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:137
msgid "Empty canonicalizes to `Trv`; a non-common interval cannot retain `Com` and canonicalizes to `Dac`."
msgstr "Empty は `Trv` に正規化され、non-common interval の `Com` は `Dac` に下がります。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:139
msgid "Operations take the weakest input/operation decoration, so a grade never improves during evaluation."
msgstr "演算結果は入力と演算自身の最も弱い decoration を取るため、評価中に等級が上がることはありません。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:141
msgid "Partial domains, possible division by zero, and trigonometric poles lower the operation grade to `Trv`."
msgstr "部分定義域、0 除算の可能性、三角関数の極では演算等級が `Trv` に下がります。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:143
msgid "Numeric operations propagate NaI; Boolean relations return `false` for NaI, while `overlap_state` returns `Undefined`."
msgstr "数値演算は NaI を伝播し、NaI を含む Boolean relation は `false`、 `overlap_state` は `Undefined` を返します。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:146
msgid "The decorated type mirrors the supported set, relation, arithmetic, cancellation, elementary-function, FMA, integer-power, extrema, and context operations and implements `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, and `Show`."
msgstr "decorated 型は集合演算、relation、算術、cancellation、初等関数、FMA、整数冪、極値、context 操作を公開し、`+`、`-`、`*`、`/`、`Show` に対応します。"

