msgstr "正確な accessor 一覧は `GdaDocument::{source,cases,case_count}`、 `GdaCase::{id,operation,normalized_operation,operands,expected,conditions,context,expression,span}`、 `GdaContext::{default,precision,rounding,min_exponent,max_exponent,clamp,extended,dectest}`、 `RunOptions::{new,shard_count,shard_index,strict_supported,case_filter}`、 `RunSummary::{total_cases,selected_cases,executable_cases,passed_cases,failed_cases,skipped_cases,diagnostic_cases,legacy_cases,unsupported_cases,results,success,merge}`、 `CaseResult::{id,passed,disposition,message}` です。"

