#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:8
msgid "Supported operations over binary16/32/64/128 are `Add`, `Subtract`, `Multiply`, `Divide`, `SquareRoot`, `MulAdd`, `Remainder`, `RoundToInt`, the integer conversions `ToInt32`/`ToInt64`/`ToUInt32`/`ToUInt64`, and the comparisons `Equal`, `LessEqual`, `Less`, `EqualSignaling`, `LessEqualQuiet`, and `LessQuiet`; `exact` selects TestFloat's `-exact` variants. A successful summary means selected rows matched values and flags; it does not expand the supported matrix."
