#: manual/design/ball_float.md:23
msgid "This pipeline separates the mathematical set rule from endpoint arithmetic. `bin_float` owns dyadic rounding and certified scalar kernels; `ball_float` owns which endpoint combinations and domain fallbacks are required to enclose the image of a set."
msgstr "Pipeline は input interval → Empty/Entire/domain classification → monotone/critical/full-product rule → lower downward / upper upward → `BallContext` → optional decoration。`bin_float` は endpoint rounding/ certificate、`ball_float` は set image の endpoint combination/domain fallback を所有します。"

