msgid "[Numeric semantics](./numeric_semantics.md) explains precision, rounding, status, special values, and interval enclosure."
msgstr "[数値意味論](./numeric_semantics.md)は precision、rounding、status、特殊値、interval enclosure を説明します。"

#: manual/getting_started.md:134
msgid "[Architecture](./architecture.md) maps stable packages to parsing, execution, and verification infrastructure."
msgstr "[Architecture](./architecture.md)は stable package と parsing/execution/verification layer を対応付けます。"

#: manual/getting_started.md:136
msgid "[Verification](./verification.md) lists quick and authoritative gates and the exact scope of each conformance claim."
msgstr "[検証](./verification.md)は quick/authoritative gate と各 conformance claim の正確な範囲を示します。"

#: manual/getting_started.md:138
msgid "Package pages in the API, tutorial, and design chapters provide callable names, workflows, and implementation boundaries respectively."
msgstr "API、チュートリアル、設計の各章にある package ページが、それぞれ callable 名、workflow、実装境界を扱います。"

#: manual/getting_started.md:140
