msgstr "numeric core の evidence は package ごとに記録します：[`bin_float`](./conformance/bin_float.md)、[`decimal`](./conformance/decimal.md)、[`decimal_gda`](./conformance/decimal_gda.md)、[`ball_float`](./conformance/ball_float.md)。"

