msgstr "expected/actual value、flags、context、target、corpus revision、command を記録します。"

#: manual/verification.md:87
msgid "Run the matching white-box package test to decide whether the defect is in parsing, arithmetic, interchange, or aggregation."
msgstr "対応 white-box package test で parser、arithmetic、interchange、aggregation を切り分けます。"

#: manual/verification.md:89
msgid "After a fix, run the focused case, committed smoke fixture, backend gate, and finally `just pr` or `just ci` as appropriate."
msgstr "修正後に focused case、smoke fixture、backend gate、最後に `just pr`/`just ci` を実行します。"

#: manual/verification.md:92
